れる？\nもぅ…少しだけだよ？\nモフモフ、モフモフ・・・はい、終わり！\n続きはまた今度！\nほら、遊ぼう？", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@N_noirloup/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=921a3a721121c241ef3931279ae9d16b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=921a3a721121c241ef3931279ae9d16b, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4502e9de4b84dc2b9f02039c2a72432 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa36d252c1bfc84b10bc1c866747ecec 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "ボイスのリクエストです。\nスマホの画面保護フィルムを剥がす勇気をくれるような応援ボイスをお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@N_noirloup/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=921a3a721121c241ef3931279ae9d16b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=921a3a721121c241ef3931279ae9d16b, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4502e9de4b84dc2b9f02039c2a72432 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa36d252c1bfc84b10bc1c866747ecec 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "・起こしてくれるボイスがほしい\n(以下はベース文なので、好きにアレンジとかアドリブとか噛んだりとかしてもらって大丈夫)\n\n「ある〜 朝だよー！起きてー！」\n「起きないとイタズラしちゃうぞ〜」\n「ほーら…こしょ…こしょこしょ…」\n「こしょ………わっ！！」\n「びっくりした？おはよ〜！」\n「今日も一日がんばろーね！」\n\n朝確実に目覚めるか、召される！！！！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@N_noirloup/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=31f93822e28d9400ebfc5148f7e04103", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=31f93822e28d9400ebfc5148f7e04103, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6cd2734dc4bbd2cda8ea6735306da6b6 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1346838514999074820%2FcXR8tBUU.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0aacce56c51f272177a294e8cae7af0b 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@N_noirloup/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F13468385